<%- include('partials/head') %>

<section class="page-hero page-hero-sm">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated <%= formatDate(updated) %></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <article class="container narrow prose">
    <p>This policy explains what personal data <%= site.name %> collects through this website, why we collect it, who we share it with and the choices you have. It is written to meet India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and the Information Technology Act, 2000.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>When you apply for a job or submit your CV:</b> your name, email, phone, resume, total experience, current location, notice period, key skills, LinkedIn or portfolio link and anything you write in the message. We also note which page or link brought you to us.</li>
      <li><b>When you share a hiring requirement or contact us:</b> your name, company, work email, phone and the details of your message.</li>
      <li><b>When you subscribe to job alerts or our newsletter:</b> your email address and the job category or city you chose.</li>
      <li><b>When you use My applications or the client portal:</b> your sign-in email, and for contractors, the timesheets you submit.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Reading your resume</h2>
    <p>When you choose a PDF or Word resume on the apply form, our server reads the text to fill in empty fields for you. Nothing is saved unless you submit the application. Once you apply, we keep the resume text with your application so our recruiters can search for and match your skills to suitable roles. Every match is reviewed by a person; no hiring decision is made automatically.</p>

    <h2>How we use your data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To assess you for the role you applied for and for similar roles, and to contact you about them</li>
      <li>To schedule interviews and send you updates on your application</li>
      <li>To respond to hiring requirements and enquiries</li>
      <li>To send job alerts and newsletters you asked for</li>
      <li>To issue invoices and keep the business and tax records the law requires</li>
      <li>To keep the site secure, for example by limiting repeated form submissions</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We rely on the consent you give when you submit a form. You can withdraw it at any time (see below).</p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>We share your profile with a client employer only to put you forward for a role. Shared profiles show your name, skills, experience and resume. We leave your email address and phone number off the profile, but the client will see any contact details written in the resume you uploaded. Interviewers we invite see your name and the role only.</p>
    <p>We use service providers to host this website and send email. They process data only on our instructions. We do not sell your personal data, and we never share it for advertising.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <% if (site.retentionMonths) { %>
    <p>We delete your applications and resume automatically <%= site.retentionMonths %> months after your last activity with us (for example, applying, an interview or a status update), or sooner if you ask. Contact messages and hiring requests are deleted after the same period. Invoices
    <% } else { %>
    <p>We keep applications while they are useful for recruitment, or until you ask us to delete them. Invoices
    <% } %> and placement records are kept for as long as Indian tax law requires, even if the candidate's other data is deleted.</p>

    <h2>Your rights and choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>See and update your data:</b> sign in at <a href="/account/login">My applications</a> with the email you applied with to view your applications and update your profile.</li>
      <li><b>Withdraw or delete:</b> from My applications you can withdraw an application, or delete all your data (applications, resumes, job alerts and newsletter) in one step.</li>
      <li><b>Unsubscribe:</b> every job alert and newsletter email has a one-click unsubscribe link.</li>
      <li><b>Anything else:</b> email us at <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a> to access, correct or erase your data, or to nominate someone to act for you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
    <p>We use only the cookies needed to keep you signed in to My applications, the client portal or the team admin area. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies. Jobs you save are stored in your own browser, not on our servers, and you can clear them from the <a href="/saved">Saved jobs</a> page. The site loads fonts from Google Fonts, which receives your IP address when the page loads.</p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>Passwords are stored as salted hashes, sign-in links are single-use and expire, and the admin area is restricted by role. No system is completely secure, so if we become aware of a breach that affects you, we will tell you and the Data Protection Board of India as the law requires.</p>

    <h2>Grievances and contact</h2>
    <p>For questions or complaints about your personal data, contact our Grievance Officer at <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a> or <%= site.phone %>, or write to <%= site.address %>. We respond within 30 days. If you are not satisfied, you may approach the Data Protection Board of India.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page. Significant changes will also be highlighted on the site.</p>
  </article>
</section>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
